  command can run with limited access to files, devices, or
  networks. It helps contain mistakes and reduce the effects of
  harmful or unintended actions.

  In this session, the sandbox is set to read-only, so commands
  can inspect files but cannot create or change them. That’s why
  [38;2;166;227;161mtouch probe.txt[39m failed.

